# Code structure (Importou)

- Explicit `public`/`private` on class members.
- Constructor injection with `private readonly`.
- Handlers: orchestration only; no private methods encoding domain policy — put that on the entity/service.
- Async: `const result = await this.dao.search(...); return result;`
- Scope queries with `membership.organizationId` (or admin), never `tenantId`.

```typescript
public async execute(query: ImportOperationPublicListQuery) {
  const result = await this.importOperationDataAccessObject.searchByOrganization(
    query.membership.organizationId,
    query.pagination,
  );
  return result;
}
```

